### 例：力的合成

```python
class Force:
    def __init__(self, x, y):
        self.fx, self.fy = x, y

    def show(self):
        print(f"Force<{self.fx}, {self.fy}>")

    def add(self, other):
        return Force(self.fx + other.fx, self.fy + other.fy)

f1 = Force(0, 1)
f2 = Force(3, 4)
f3 = f1.add(f2)
f3.show()          # Force<3, 5>
```

